  "body": "Spun out from https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/10126.\r\n\r\nIt would be nice to have a little introduction to Matrix, ecosystem concepts and where a homeserver sits in all of it, in order to give sysadmins a working model as they set things up. Currently, the docs just plainly mention that Synapse is a Matrix homeserver implementation.\r\n\r\nWe could also include the following visual aid:\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1342360/137470787-3474d1a4-7b2f-40c3-918c-284fafd12eab.png)\r\n",
